{"id":"n90896-1-6","stage":1,"title":"다음날 · 改天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90896-1-6-1","ko":"너에게 빌린 책을 언제 돌려줄까?","zh":"我向你借的书什么时候还？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너에게","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빌린","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌려줄까?","meaning":"还给，归还，退还","explanation":"돌려주다：还给，归还，退还；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"돌려주다","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66267","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌려주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"b3f7b95886de6d80","term":"돌려주다","zh":"还给，归还，退还","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3","entryId":"66267","definition":"把借、抢或收到的财物还给原主。","pronunciation":["돌려주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2fc61e3526edcd9948a6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90896-1-6-2","ko":"다음날 만날 일이 생기면 그때 줘.","zh":"以后见面的时候再还吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음날","meaning":"改天，下次，以后，回头","explanation":"다음날：改天，下次，以后，回头","readings":[{"term":"다음날","audio":"/audio/18623d19ccdacc4f9c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90896","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만날","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생기면","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그때","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"18623d19ccdacc4f","term":"다음날","zh":"改天，下次，以后，回头","audio":"/audio/18623d19ccdacc4f9c76.mp3","entryId":"90896","definition":"不确定的未来的某一天。","pronunciation":["다음날"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"2d0b6f3e4d1966c4","term":"그때","zh":"那时，那时候","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3","entryId":"29683","definition":"前面所说的某一时间。","pronunciation":["그때"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3ed35af86746dd25170.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90896","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["以后见面的时候再还吧。","为什么把窗帘都拉得严严实实的，这么黑啊？","我向你借的书什么时候还？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["以后见面的时候再还吧。","我向你借的书什么时候还？","为什么把窗帘都拉得严严实实的，这么黑啊？"],"answer":0}]}
